## Multiple Zoom Axes

What to test:

- Drag-zoom the chart and check both axes respond to the same gesture.
- Pan the zoomed region and verify the axis domains stay in sync.

{% chartExampleRunner title="Axes Zoom" name="multiple-zoom-axes" type="generated" /%}

## Multi Touch Zoompan

What to test:

- Pinch-zoom on a touch device and confirm the chart zooms smoothly.
- Two-finger pan the zoomed view and check both charts behave consistently.

{% chartExampleRunner title="Multi Touch Zoom" name="multitouch-zoompan" type="generated" /%}

## onDataChange

What to test:

- Click the plus button to append data and verify the chart updates without losing zoom state.
- Switch the x-axis type between number and category and confirm the chart re-renders correctly.

{% chartExampleRunner title="onDataChange" name="on-data-change" type="generated" options={ "exampleHeight": 1000 } /%}

## AG-16803 Infinite Loop

What to test:

- Zoom in on the bar chart and confirm rendering completes without entering an infinite loop.

{% chartExampleRunner title="infinite-loop" name="infinite-loop" type="generated" /%}

